<title>USA: Apartment Investment files proxy for merger.</title>
<headline>Apartment Investment files proxy for merger.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apartment Investment and Management Co said Thursday it filed with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission preliminary proxy materials relating to its proposed merger with NHP Inc.</p>
<p>As previously announced, the two companies have entered into an agreement providing for the merger of an Apartment Investment subsidiary with NHP.</p>
<p>Another Apartment Investment subsidiary currently owns about 51.3 percent of the outstanding shares of NHP common stock.</p>
</text>
